again from. For a composition a team shares 'error.details.lastEditedBy' ('{ id, name }', or
'null' when nobody can be named) and 'error.details.lastEditedAt' say who saved first and when. An editor
session, or a call made for one managed user, is told the version only.${OFF}" | paste -sd' ' | column -t -s ';' | fold -sw 80 | sed '2,$s/^/       /'
    code=503
